# Raw reference files (PDFs, spreadsheets) are read/converted locally and NOT committed.
source-material/**
# EXCEPTION: text-based data we fetch/compile (hard data + source URLs) IS committed, so
# the repo always retains the underlying data. Keep these as .md next to the raw files.
!source-material/**/
!source-material/**/*.md

